        - wrangler_agents.list_agents (tools.wrangler_agents__list_agents): List retained agents in the current ...tree, including unloaded agents (agent_status: null). [hash=e7c3805d318aabbc]
        - wrangler_agents.send_message (tools.wrangler_agents__send_message): Send a message to an existing agent.
